#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:174
msgid "%s is not a Google News address."
msgstr "%s nie jest adresem Google News."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:327
msgid "Google News Campaign Type."
msgstr "Rodzaj kampanii Google News."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:328
msgid ""
"Paste the address of a Google News search, topic or publication as your "
"browser shows it, and the campaign finds its feed on its own:"
msgstr ""
"Wklej adres wyszukiwania, tematu lub serwisu Google News tak, jak pokazuje "
"go twoja przeglądarka, a kampania sama znajdzie kanał informacyjny:"

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:332
msgid ""
"Each item brings the headline, the date and the name of the publication, and "
"links to Google News."
msgstr ""
"Każdy element przynosi nagłówek, datę i nazwę serwisu oraz prowadzi do "
"Google News."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:333
msgid ""
"The name and the address of the publication are saved with each post, and "
"the post template takes them as {source_name} and {source_url}."
msgstr ""
"Nazwa i adres serwisu są zapisywane z każdym wpisem, a szablon wpisu "
"przyjmuje je jako {source_name} i {source_url}."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:336
msgid "Publication in the title."
msgstr "Serwis w tytule."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:337
msgid ""
"Google News ends every headline with the name of the publication. The "
"campaign takes it off; tick this to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Google News kończy każdy nagłówek nazwą serwisu. Kampania ją usuwa; zaznacz "
"to, aby ją zachować."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:340
msgid "Related coverage."
msgstr "Powiązane materiały."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:341
msgid ""
"On a topic, Google News lists other articles about the same story under each "
"headline. Tick this to add that list to the post."
msgstr ""
"W temacie Google News wymienia pod każdym nagłówkiem inne artykuły o tej "
"samej sprawie. Zaznacz to, aby dodać tę listę do wpisu."

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:352
msgid "Google News Campaign Options"
msgstr "Opcje kampanii Google News"

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:373
msgid "Keep the name of the publication at the end of the title"
msgstr "Zachowaj nazwę serwisu na końcu tytułu"

#: includes/campaign-types/googlo_news.php:375
msgid "Add the related coverage Google News lists under the headline"
