#: includes/class-tour-helper.php:225
msgid ""
"Every WPeMatico add-on, installed or not. The free ones install from here."
msgstr ""
"Wszystkie dodatki WPeMatico, zainstalowane lub nie. Darmowe instaluje się "
"stąd."

#: includes/class-tour-helper.php:231
msgid "Activate and license"
msgstr "Włącz i podaj licencję"

#: includes/class-tour-helper.php:232
msgid ""
"Activate what you have, and enter its licence in Settings › Licenses to "
