msgstr "Kliknij, aby przełączyć"

#: includes/settings/page.php:167
msgid "Global Settings for Images"
msgstr "Globalne ustawienia obrazków"

#: includes/settings/page.php:251
msgid "Allowed image extensions"
msgstr "Dozwolone rozszerzenia obrazków"

#: includes/settings/page.php:254 includes/settings/page.php:342
#: includes/settings/page.php:407
msgid "Separate the allowed extensions with commas."
msgstr "Rozdziel dozwolone rozszerzenia przecinkami."

#: includes/settings/page.php:255
msgid "WordPress image types:"
msgstr "Rodzaje obrazków WordPressa:"

#: includes/settings/page.php:255 includes/settings/page.php:343
#: includes/settings/page.php:408
msgid "Click to restore the WordPress defaults."
msgstr "Kliknij, aby przywrócić domyślne ustawienia WordPressa."

#: includes/settings/page.php:256 includes/settings/page.php:344
#: includes/settings/page.php:409
msgid "Recommended:"
msgstr "Zalecane:"

#: includes/settings/page.php:256 includes/settings/page.php:344
#: includes/settings/page.php:409
msgid "Click to use the recommended values."
msgstr "Kliknij, aby użyć zalecanych wartości."

#: includes/settings/page.php:280
msgid ""
"&ldquo;Set first image in content as Featured Image.&rdquo; is off, so "
"nothing picks the image to link &mdash; unless an addon such as Professional "
"or Full Content supplies one."
msgstr ""
"Opcja &ldquo;Ustaw pierwszy obrazek w treści jako obrazek "
"wyróżniający.&rdquo; jest wyłączona, więc nic nie wybiera obrazka do "
"podlinkowania &mdash; chyba że dostarczy go dodatek taki jak Professional "
"lub Full Content."

#: includes/settings/page.php:292
msgid "Global Settings for Videos"
msgstr "Globalne ustawienia filmów"

#: includes/settings/page.php:32 includes/settings/page.php:37
msgid "Permission check failed"
msgstr "Sprawdzenie uprawnień nie powiodło się"

#: includes/settings/page.php:340
msgid "Allowed video extensions"
msgstr "Dozwolone rozszerzenia filmów"

#: includes/settings/page.php:343
msgid "WordPress video types:"
msgstr "Rodzaje filmów WordPressa:"

#: includes/settings/page.php:356
msgid "Global Settings for Audios"
msgstr "Globalne ustawienia plików dźwiękowych"

#: includes/settings/page.php:404
msgid "Allowed audio extensions"
msgstr "Dozwolone rozszerzenia plików dźwiękowych"

#: includes/settings/page.php:408
msgid "WordPress audio types:"
